{"id":17991,"name":"Colbert County","slug":"colbert-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/colbert-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:22","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","bidProcedure":"Bid Down Method starting at 12%","redemptionPeriod":"3 years for land tax sales","interestRate":"12%","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"For land: first Monday in May"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"GovEase Auction Site"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Colbert County Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"WMybex\"><iframe title=\"How Investing Yields 12% Annually - Colbert County - Alabama Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zR-gJdJD1NI?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-Investing-Yields-12%-Annually---Colbert-County---Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\">How Investing Yields 12% Annually &#8211; Colbert County &#8211; Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Want to make your money work harder? Try the Tax Lien Sale in Colbert County, Alabama, where your investment can grow at an impressive 12% interest.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Alabama&#8217;s unique system lets you buy a lien against delinquent properties. Here’s the scoop: starting in 2019, Alabama introduced an online auction system for tax liens, a shift from traditional sales. This means you can participate from anywhere, bidding down interest rates starting at 12%.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-Tax-Lien-Certificates-or-Tax-Deeds\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates or Tax Deeds</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Lien Certificates:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You&#8217;re essentially lending money to the property owner to pay off their taxes.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>If the owner redeems the property, you get your money back plus interest.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>If not redeemed within three years, you might foreclose and get the property.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Tax Deeds:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>You purchase the property directly.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>No redemption period—it&#8217;s yours once the auction is over.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Lien-Investing\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"1.-Research-and-Understand-Local-Laws\">1. Research and Understand Local Laws</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Check out the legal framework and regulations in Colbert County. Knowing the laws helps you make informed decisions.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"2.-Visit-the-Local-Treasurer's-Website\">2. Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Colbert County Tax Lien Information:</strong> <a href=\"https://govease.helpscoutdocs.com/article/97-alabama-tax-lien-auction-overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase Overview</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Colbert Revenue Commissioner:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.revenuecommissioner.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Colbert Revenue Commissioner</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Colbert County:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.colbertcounty.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Colbert County</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"3.-Check-the-Auction-Site\">3. Check the Auction Site</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Auctions are held online at <a href=\"https://liveauctions.govease.com/PublicPortal/PublicRegisterAuctions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"4.-Read-the-Details-about-Tax-Liens-or-Tax-Deeds\">4. Read the Details about Tax Liens or Tax Deeds</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiry, and other essential details. You need to be thorough with your research before bidding.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"5.-Contact-the-County-Office\">5. Contact the County Office</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>For additional inquiries, reach out to the Colbert County Revenue Commissioner at (256) 386-8530 or email <a href=\"mailto:revenuecommissioner@colbertco.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">revenuecommissioner@colbertco.org</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Colbert-County-Alabama-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18001 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Colbert County Courthouse Alabama\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Always verify the property details and any potential issues.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Understand the redemption process thoroughly.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be prepared for the responsibilities that come with potentially owning a property.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Community-Appeal-and-Economic-Highlights\">Community Appeal and Economic Highlights</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Colbert County offers a blend of scenic beauty and economic opportunity:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Popular Attractions:</strong> Parks, theatres, and historic sites are aplenty.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Transportation Infrastructure:</strong> Well-connected by roads, rails, and nearby airports.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Economic Development:</strong> Growth in sectors like agriculture, technology, and manufacturing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner redeems the property?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You will get your investment back plus the interest accrued at the bid rate.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What if the property is not redeemed within the redemption period?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You can potentially foreclose and take ownership of the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I register for the auction?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Register online through GovEase before the auction begins.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is the bid procedure?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The auctions use a bid-down method from 12% to 0%.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://govease.helpscoutdocs.com/article/97-alabama-tax-lien-auction-overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase Help Center</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.revenuecommissioner.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class